      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Polyethylene is a plastic film made from ethylene, a hydrocarbon mainly obtained from natural gas or oil. It is commonly used in packaging for pharmaceuticals, household chemicals, and food items. There are different types of polyethylene film, influenced by the degree and form of side branching from the polymer chain. Polyethylene terephthalates are solid forms of polyester, and rival polyethylene in packaging applications.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "聚乙烯是一种由乙烯制成的塑料薄膜，乙烯是一种碳氢化合物，主要从天然气或石油中提取。它常用于药品、家用化学品和食品的包装。聚乙烯薄膜有不同的类型，受聚合物链的侧枝程度和形式的影响。聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯是聚酯的固态形式，在包装应用中可与聚乙烯相媲美。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
